{
  "name": "FlixBus prices for the next 30 days to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FlixBus prices for the next 30 days to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, fetch every FlixBus and FlixTrain ride on your routes for the next 30 days, with price, seats and the cheapest ride of each day flagged, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get FlixBus trips** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get FlixBus trips** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $1 per 1,000 trips. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/flixbus-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "0f87c818-8d40-45ea-bef7-14e56dad6014"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "f3a5bde9-43cc-4695-8f2b-c732d15c895b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/om_kh~flixbus-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
